# Rule Hygiene

- At the start of every task, check if the request introduces durable engineering preferences, DOM selector updates, or packaging expectations.
- Keep rules concise, concrete, and actionable.
- Update `.cursor/rules/`, `.cursor/agents/`, `.cursor/skills/`, and `.agents/AGENTS.md` simultaneously when rules change.
